WEBVTT

31:31.416 --> 31:34.502
if I was being treated well,
if I liked it here.

31:36.588 --> 31:39.466
But then he started
asking me about my mother.

31:39.591 --> 31:43.052
- Your mother?
- Who she was, what she looked like.

31:43.178 --> 31:45.472
What did you tell him?

31:47.015 --> 31:49.684
She died when I was little.

31:49.809 --> 31:51.644
She had yellow hair.

31:52.312 --> 31:54.898
She'd sing to me sometimes.

31:58.193 --> 31:59.903
Look at me.
